WEBVTT

00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:09.700
Senpai, you can't peek.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:12.250
I know, I'm not going to.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.780
Damn it, Aladar, that bastard.

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:22.280
Senpai.

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.070
Uhh, do you want to eat it?

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:27.560
Eat what, Himeragi!?

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:29.690
Huh?

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:30.610
Oh, cookies?

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:32.540
They're emergency rations.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:36.230
Wait, Senpai, what did you think of just now?

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:38.010
Ah, no, nothing...

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:38.940
Geez.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:42.090
Senpai, you're a really lewd person, aren't you?

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:46.330
When I was at Minamiya-sensei's home, I had a bit of time.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:50.030
This... has absolutely nothing to do with Valentine's Day.

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:52.440
Yeah, it's all right, whatever.

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:53.960
Thanks, Himeragi.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.650
Thank you for the meal!

00:00:57.720 --> 00:00:59.420
It's super delicious!

00:00:59.650 --> 00:01:01.310
Really?

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.160
The plane is under attack.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:08.790
All hands, level one battle stations!

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:10.060
I repeat.

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:41.060
What happened?

00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:42.970
You finished so quickly.

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:45.070
Did you finish "replenishing"?

00:02:45.070 --> 00:02:46.570
Yeah, I had my fill...

00:02:46.570 --> 00:02:47.590
Wait, no!

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:49.880
Not in the way you meant it!

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:52.230
Anyway, is this really okay?

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:54.450
We're being attacked by Nalakuvera.

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:57.600
That Asagi...

00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:00.380
is she trying to kill us for real?

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:02.490
Your Highness! We cannot maintain this altitude.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.300
At this rate, we will crash!

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.360
Is this our limit?

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:09.430
All hands, brace for impact!

00:03:09.430 --> 00:03:10.400
What?

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:13.650
We've reached the airspace above our destination.

00:03:13.650 --> 00:03:14.650
That's enough.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:22.100
Damn. Come, Natra Cinereus!

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.390
Ouch...

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:32.240
Himeragi, are you okay?

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:34.060
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:36.240
Good grief, this is nuts.

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:37.570
You, and Asagi too.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.610
Akatsuki Kojou, you go on ahead.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.180
Huh?

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:46.600
These guys are Vatler's...

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:51.570
I'll be their opponent.

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.630
Airship "Night Owl" has crashed!

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:01.900
Holy Barrier Shield...  the output is dropping!

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.930
At this rate, we wont even last ten minutes!

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:07.140
Prepare the transporter room.

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:11.320
Destination is the Nalakuvera controller's hiding place.

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:13.630
Wait, that's insane!

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:14.620
Sayaka.

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:18.660
Do you really want to get married to Kojou?

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:19.720
What?

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:21.620
Why would you ask that in this situation?

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:24.030
This is precisely the time to ask.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.680
Listen, Sayaka.

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:29.610
The purpose of this battle is to make Kojou the sovereign of his own Empire of the Night.

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.670
After our victory,

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:34.800
He has an obligation to gather exceptional Blood Followers.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.580
In other words,

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:39.050
to build his harem!

00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:42.410
If you do not have the resolve to become a part of it,

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:44.960
then I cannot keep you around anymore.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:52.290
I... I have never considered becoming Akatsuki Kojou's Blood Servant.

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:55.240
Transporter room, activation ready!

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:56.850
What do you think?

00:04:57.620 --> 00:04:58.780
Are you coming?

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.200
Geez, I don't care anymore!

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:05.250
If I could be with Yukina, I'll join the harem or whatever!

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:09.370
That's good enough for now.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:12.970
After we teleport, the Bifrost will standby in the air.

00:05:12.970 --> 00:05:17.200
Divert all energy from the Spirit Engine to the Holy Barrier Shield if you wish.

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:18.920
Energize!

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:31.790
Boyfriend-dono!

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:35.610
Realize that I'm only following orders!

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:37.200
This is tough...

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:39.830
I can't destroy her with my Familiars.

00:05:40.300 --> 00:05:42.120
Do it, Astarte.

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:43.380
Accept.

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:45.840
Execute, Rhododactylos.

00:05:45.840 --> 00:05:47.100
Oh my!

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.410
Natsuki-chan!

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:52.740
You came to help us?

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:55.570
I'm not here to help you.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:59.200
That little girl's homeroom teacher is my acquaintance.

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:02.690
Rejoice.

00:06:02.810 --> 00:06:05.760
A special detention awaits you.

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:08.030
W-Wait, sensei-dono.

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:11.050
Have mercy, in way of the samurai...

00:06:18.970 --> 00:06:20.960
Those bullets are... The Cleansing?

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:28.230
Asagi!

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:31.370
I'll stop Aiba-senpai.

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:33.780
Senpai, use this opportunity to defeat Lord Ardeal.

00:06:34.430 --> 00:06:35.300
Hurry!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.180
I'm counting on you, Himeragi.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:46.820
The delegates of countries not allied with The Holy Ground Treaty.

00:06:48.310 --> 00:06:50.810
Looks like they are barely breathing.

00:06:52.130 --> 00:06:55.090
Damn it Vatler, what is the meaning of this?

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:57.820
As soon as they heard that the fourth Progenitor became an enemy,

00:06:57.820 --> 00:07:00.430
they started to chicken out.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:04.460
Since they tried to run way, I gave them a punishment.

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:08.660
For cowards who tarnish the holy war,

00:07:08.800 --> 00:07:10.780
that is a fitting look, right?

00:07:10.870 --> 00:07:12.290
Damn you!

00:07:12.770 --> 00:07:13.780
Natsuki-chan,

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.090
take the delegates to the hospital.

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:18.020
I'll hurt that bastard.

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:24.870
Come, Regulus-Aurum!

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.140
Batsunanda!

00:07:29.870 --> 00:07:32.760
Oh, it's like a dream, Kojou!

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:35.720
I get the chance to fight you like this.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:40.250
Now, I'll show you my new powers.

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:45.890
This power is...

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.140
The Cleansing?

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:55.050
Mesarthim Adamas.

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:07.980
Don't tell me this is goodbye already, Kojou.

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:16.170
Glenda, please!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:17.730
Daaaa!

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:25.300
Freikugel Plus, Full Burst.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:48.520
Aiba-senpai, please stop!

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.780
Even without a war, we can still save Itogami Island

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:54.560
as long as Akatsuki-senpai defeats Lord Ardeal.

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:56.880
That would be meaningless!

00:08:57.060 --> 00:08:59.720
The Fourth Progenitor becomes the king of Itogami Island,

00:08:59.720 --> 00:09:00.990
then what?

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:03.290
Can he return to being an ordinary high school student?

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:06.480
Sacrificing the place he belongs to for Itogami Island doesn't solve anything!

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:08.730
Don't take away the place where Kojou should be!

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:21.430
Whether Senpai is the Fourth Progenitor or the sovereign of an Empire of the Night is irrelevant.

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:24.370
I'll protect the place where Senpai belongs,

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.710
the observer exists for this purpose!

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:29.520
What do you have there?

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:31.170
What are those wings?

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:31.990
An angel!?

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:34.600
Just because your face is a little cute means you have it all?

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:38.180
The cute one is Aiba-senpai!

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:39.930
So smart and such a sexy figure.

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:42.340
Akatsuki-senpai is always depending on you!

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:44.950
The one Kojou depends on is you!

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:46.800
Although I'm not clear on whatever this "observer" thing is.

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:47.850
The two of you are always together

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:50.130
being lovey-dovey! Lovey-dovey! Lovey-dovey! Lovey-dovey! Lovey-dovey!

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:51.570
What about Aiba-senpai?

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:55.100
In class, at lunch, you two are always inseparable!

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:08.170
And another thing, I never got a ring from Kojou!

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:10.900
This ring is equipment from the Lion King Organization!

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:13.470
It's not the same as Aiba-senpai's earrings!

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:15.480
But Kojou put the ring on you.

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:16.560
That's not fair!

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:17.800
Aiba-senpai, you...

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:21.570
you always have Akatsuki-senpai call you by your first name!

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:25.010
You're bothered about that.

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:26.410
That's surprising.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:44.860
Glenda!

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:46.230
Glenda!

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:50.060
Kojou-kun.

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:51.090
Kojou!

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:52.130
Senpai!

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:53.510
What happened to him?

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:55.280
How did this happen?

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:56.430
Look over there.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.050
No way, that's The Cleansing?

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:05.920
Those magic circles... Hikawa-senpai?

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.890
She said that until Kojou recovers she will be a decoy

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:09.730
by herself.

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:15.840
Aiba-senpai, please take care of Akatsuki-senpai.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.460
Eh? Wait!

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:25.590
Kojou, wake up.

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:26.860
Wake up now!

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:30.050
A-Asagi-chan.

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:33.840
Open your eyes,

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:35.620
Kojou!

00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:37.250
Yo...

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:42.740
are you crying again?

00:11:43.880 --> 00:11:45.350
Again?

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:47.680
I've never cried in front of you before.

00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:59.100
I hate you.

00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:01.270
How long are you going to remember that for?

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:09.380
A...Asagi?

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:10.500
I'm sorry.

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:13.990
I'm not experienced at this.

00:12:15.430 --> 00:12:16.510
So...

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:27.670
This is incredibly embarrassing.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:30.310
My heart is pounding.

00:12:30.820 --> 00:12:32.430
What's with you, Asagi?

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:33.830
Wanting to do something like this.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:37.040
I want you to suck my blood.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:41.950
As long as it's with you, Kojou, I don't mind.

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:45.020
Asagi.

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:49.720
I'll be as gentle as I can,

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:51.510
but it might hurt a little at the start.

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:53.340
I'll bear it.

00:12:54.020 --> 00:12:55.640
Do whatever you feel like.

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:25.920
Hikawa-senpai.

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:27.120
What's with the wings?

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:28.760
A lot happened.

00:13:33.740 --> 00:13:34.810
Kirasaka?

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:37.900
La Folia.

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:42.900
Why?

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:45.320
What?

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:46.560
What's going on?

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:49.420
Vatler's Familiar suddenly disappeared.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:50.790
Disappeared?

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:51.900
Why?

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:55.310
Hey, Asagi.

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:57.470
You look pleased.

00:13:57.950 --> 00:13:59.570
Shut up, I'm the same as usual.

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:01.450
Anyway, what do you want?

00:14:01.450 --> 00:14:03.980
It's about the disappearance of Vatler's Familiar.

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:06.060
A few minutes ago,

00:14:06.190 --> 00:14:09.390
the dragon veins that flowed around Itogami Island was blocked.

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:13.160
For now, the power of the Cleansing should be plummeting.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:15.460
Blocking the dragon veins...

00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:16.740
is that even possible?

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:19.980
Yes, that's why I came here,

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:21.010
Kojou-san.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.000
Yume?

00:14:22.550 --> 00:14:25.750
By having Leviathan invoke the greatest magical barrier,

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:28.290
we can block the flow of the dragon veins.

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:29.590
That's amazing.

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:31.200
Thanks, Yume.

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:34.700
I am so glad I was able to help you, Onii-san.

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:37.450
But even Leviathan can't last that long.

00:14:37.450 --> 00:14:40.500
It can only continue for 30 minutes.

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:42.700
Come up with something in the meantime.

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:43.820
I got it.

00:14:45.760 --> 00:14:47.340
30 minutes, eh?

00:14:47.340 --> 00:14:49.030
That's not much time.

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:51.610
Senpai, have you recovered?

00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:52.490
How's your injury?

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.020
I'm fine.

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:56.150
La Folia and Kirasaka are here too?

00:14:56.150 --> 00:14:57.180
Perfect.

00:14:57.180 --> 00:14:59.440
About Vatler's Familiar's disappearance:

00:14:59.570 --> 00:15:02.450
Leviathan is blocking the dragon veins.

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:04.510
But there's a time limit.

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:06.040
We only have 30 minutes.

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:08.470
So, um...

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:09.950
Himeragi...san?

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:15.020
Use this, Kojou.

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:16.930
I'm sorry.

00:15:17.140 --> 00:15:19.660
I did a lot of things to hinder you.

00:15:19.780 --> 00:15:20.840
It's alright.

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:22.540
You did them for me, right?

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:24.220
Thanks, Asagi.

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:29.920
Himeragi-san, please take care of Kojou.

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:30.500
Eh?

00:15:30.640 --> 00:15:33.050
I took care of him just now.

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:34.500
Now, it's your turn.

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:40.630
I'm only speculating, but your spear is probably the only thing that can defeat Vatler-san.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.020
Yeah!

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.780
Go, Akatsuki Kojou!

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:51.610
We will prepare a fabulous wedding for your return.

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:53.220
No, don't prepared that!

00:15:53.610 --> 00:15:55.400
Don't say scary things like that randomly.

00:15:56.310 --> 00:16:00.770
Listen, you two have to come back safe and sound... 
to this island of ours.

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:05.100
Sorry.

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:06.760
You had to accompany me in the end.

00:16:06.760 --> 00:16:08.240
Why would you say that now?

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:11.950
You involved me in a lot of things before

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:14.520
and did so many things to me.

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:18.030
You're making me sound like a criminal.

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:23.190
But, no matter where you go or what you do, I'll always be with you,

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:25.720
because I'm Senpai's observer.

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:40.080
You've finally returned.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:42.640
I grew weary of waiting, Kojou.

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:44.470
Vatler.

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:48.040
This place is...

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:49.150
That's right.

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:52.280
It's the place where the Fourth Progenitor defeated Cain.

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:56.360
For one who acquired the power of The Cleansing to fight you,

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:58.650
it's the perfect stage, isn't it?

00:16:58.650 --> 00:16:59.620
You're wrong.

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:02.920
The Fourth Progenitor killed Cain

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:04.900
because the Devas cursed him.

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:08.150
The curse known as Root.

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:11.090
They needed the Fourth Progenitor to be Cain's observer.

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:14.420
Yet they feared that she was becoming Cain's ally.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:15.970
So the Devas laid a trap.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.090
That's right.

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:21.830
The Fourth Progenitor fell into despair after killing Cain, her friend.

00:17:21.940 --> 00:17:25.480
So she rebelled against her creators, the Devas.

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:30.320
But eventually she was defeated, split into 12 pieces, and sealed.

00:17:30.930 --> 00:17:32.820
An irredeemable tale.

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:34.400
Not exactly.

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:35.050
Oh?

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:39.650
Avrora is still alive, Hektos and Nagisa saved her.

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:41.610
Stop it, Vatler.

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:44.060
Cain doesn't want this outcome!

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:48.270
In addition, the power of The Cleansing that Cain left behind to defeat the Devas

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.470
cannot be used by you anymore.

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.220
I know that.

00:17:53.240 --> 00:17:56.380
But that doesn't matter right now.

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:59.530
This is a rare opportunity to fight you in earnest!

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:01.120
Nanda!

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:02.410
Batsunanda!

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:13.780
I have been bored for so long.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.990
It was really tiresome.

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:18.700
In repeating a foolish piece of history

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.450
in this ever unchanging world,

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:25.690
only the most glorious fight to the death

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:28.070
can relieve me of my boredom!

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:32.140
Let me experience the splendor of life as it teeters toward anniliation,

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:33.160
Kojou!

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:35.360
Regulus Aurum!

00:18:36.930 --> 00:18:38.690
You're pathetic, Vatler!

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:40.850
What are you afraid of?

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:42.130
What?

00:18:42.130 --> 00:18:46.570
You're acting like a child. When things don't go your way you throw a temper tantrum.

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:50.050
You're incapable of creating something to overcome your boredom,

00:18:50.170 --> 00:18:52.870
always chasing a fleeting moment of euphoria.

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:57.170
Don't fool yourself into thinking that you can continue this forever!

00:18:58.580 --> 00:18:59.970
Brilliant, Kojou.

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:02.350
Your words are refreshing.

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:06.470
No opponent has ever said anything like that to me before!

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:09.220
Shut up!

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:12.110
You wont take anything away.

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:14.440
If you want to destroy the world,

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:15.900
then I will protect it!

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:20.410
From now on, this is my fight!

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:32.330
No, Senpai, this is our fight!

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:34.560
This is exhilarating, Kojou!

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:38.620
Let me experience more and more of this delightful battle!

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:40.840
Ananta!

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:48.790
Such incredible magical power,

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:51.010
can I really defeat him?

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:52.000
This...

00:20:00.910 --> 00:20:07.330
I, Akatsuki Kojou, successor to the blood of Kaleid Blood, now release your constraints.

00:20:07.370 --> 00:20:11.840
Come, Eighth Familiar, Shaula Viola!

00:20:16.850 --> 00:20:19.220
So you can even oppose Ananta?

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:21.770
My beloved Fourth Progenitor,

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:24.030
you're the best!

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:25.370
Die!

00:20:31.700 --> 00:20:32.770
Senpai.

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:37.970
The Familiar Hektos-san left me, I'll return it to you.

00:20:38.240 --> 00:20:39.340
Himeragi.

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:40.550
No!

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:45.500
Just once, please call me by my name.

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:47.660
Like for Nagisa-chan, Aiba-senpai,

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:50.720
and Avrora-san, too.

00:20:55.180 --> 00:20:56.880
Come, Yukina.

00:20:59.010 --> 00:21:00.080
Yes!

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:14.760
Come, Minelauva Iris!

00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:16.130
Kiffa-Ater!

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:34.510
Akatsuki Kojou!

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:37.550
He transformed?

00:21:37.550 --> 00:21:39.400
That's your trump card?

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:42.510
You and I will become one, Kojou.

00:21:42.510 --> 00:21:45.110
We will become the new Fourth Progenitor.

00:21:45.890 --> 00:21:47.350
Sorry, Vatler.

00:21:47.350 --> 00:21:49.060
It's our victory!

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:53.660
I, Sword Shaman of the High God and priestess of the Lion, beseech thee.

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:58.370
Dawn light of exorcism, spirit wolf of snowy mist, grant me the divine might of thy steel,

00:21:58.970 --> 00:22:01.370
It's over, Vatler!

00:22:03.690 --> 00:22:06.680
that I may smite a hundred evil spirits!

00:22:16.550 --> 00:22:20.180
You're not going to finish me off, Kojou?

00:22:20.500 --> 00:22:22.860
I don't hate you that much.

00:22:23.370 --> 00:22:25.620
Too bad. If it's you,

00:22:26.010 --> 00:22:28.820
then being devoured doesn't sound that bad.

00:22:34.430 --> 00:22:36.640
We apologize for all the rudeness we have shown you,

00:22:36.640 --> 00:22:37.940
Fourth Progenitor.

00:22:38.540 --> 00:22:42.190
We are grateful to you for making His Highness's wish come true.

00:22:45.020 --> 00:22:46.640
Node's Erosion?

00:22:47.020 --> 00:22:48.840
Vatler, you...

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:53.180
I had planned from the beginning to do this if I was defeated.

00:22:53.910 --> 00:22:56.760
After Cain, The Sinful God, was exiled,

00:22:56.760 --> 00:23:00.450
he gained the wisdom of The Cleansing from the alternate dimension, Node.

00:23:00.450 --> 00:23:03.450
What kind of enemies will I encounter there?

00:23:03.450 --> 00:23:06.520
Looks like I won't be bored for a while.

00:23:12.210 --> 00:23:13.870
Kojou, have you heard?

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:17.420
The Holy Ground Treaty Organization issued a communiqué.

00:23:17.420 --> 00:23:20.920
They have revoked Itogami Island's designation as a magical weapon of mass destruction

00:23:21.100 --> 00:23:24.860
and formally recognized it as the territory of the Fourth Progenitor.

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:26.590
The fourth Empire of the Night.

00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:28.890
Come home quickly,

00:23:28.890 --> 00:23:30.170
I'm waiting for you!

00:23:34.650 --> 00:23:36.680
Shall we go, Himeragi?

00:23:41.180 --> 00:23:42.170
Uhh...

00:23:42.170 --> 00:23:43.370
Himeragi-san?

00:23:43.970 --> 00:23:46.190
It's nothing.

00:23:46.190 --> 00:23:48.120
Senpai, you idiot!

00:25:21.590 --> 00:25:23.100
It's hot.

00:25:23.100 --> 00:25:24.170
I'm burning.

00:25:24.170 --> 00:25:25.910
I'm burnt.

00:25:25.910 --> 00:25:27.860
I'm turning to ash.

00:25:28.360 --> 00:25:32.320
Hey, I'm the sovereign of the Empire of the Night, right?

00:25:32.320 --> 00:25:34.340
You sure are...

00:25:34.560 --> 00:25:38.560
Then why do I still have to do my spring break homework here?

00:25:38.700 --> 00:25:41.200
Is this something the Vampire Progenitor should do?

00:25:41.200 --> 00:25:44.080
Senpai, stop complaining

00:25:44.150 --> 00:25:47.170
unless you want to be classmates with me and Nagisa-chan.

00:26:15.670 --> 00:26:18.600
Natsuki-chan-sensei sent an urgent request.

00:26:18.600 --> 00:26:20.880
From the Island North B Level research facility,

00:26:20.880 --> 00:26:23.760
a magical life-form has escaped.

00:26:24.710 --> 00:26:26.640
Island North B Level...

00:26:28.170 --> 00:26:30.920
Isn't that next to the hospital where Avrora is staying?

00:26:34.550 --> 00:26:35.790
No helping it,

00:26:35.790 --> 00:26:37.040
time to go to work.

00:26:38.610 --> 00:26:41.410
I'll help you evacuate the citizens.

00:26:41.880 --> 00:26:43.990
Please take care of the magical life-form.

00:26:47.950 --> 00:26:49.860
Let's go, Senpai!

00:27:03.640 --> 00:27:05.690
Give me a break!
